WEBVTT

00:03:58.857 --> 00:04:01.226
(Laughter)

00:04:02.386 --> 00:04:04.104
Let me give you an example.

00:04:04.128 --> 00:04:07.717
I've brought some bacterial data
that can be a bit tricky to understand

00:04:07.741 --> 00:04:08.892
if you're not trained,

00:04:08.916 --> 00:04:10.261
but try to take a look.

00:04:11.548 --> 00:04:13.467
(Laughter)

00:04:14.959 --> 00:04:18.436
Here's a happy bacterial family
that has infected a patient.

00:04:20.261 --> 00:04:22.294
Let's call them the Montague family.

00:04:23.920 --> 00:04:27.381
They share resources,
they reproduce, and they grow.

00:04:28.294 --> 00:04:30.273
One day, they get a new neighbor,